Since that gives a piecewise constant model, more bins might be preferable,
or one can use the piecewise quadratic rw2 model constructed via the spde model,
with example in Section 3.1 of the “read this first” spde tutorial:
http://www.r-inla.org/examples/tutorials/spde-tutorial-from-jss

Finn

